@page "/notifications"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<div class="glass-card animate-fade-in">
    <h2>🔔 Application 06: Configurable Notification Service</h2>
    <p class="text-secondary">Demonstrates configuration injection, dependency injection (DI) patterns, and responsive component UI switching.</p>

    <div class="row mt-4">
        <div class="col-md-5">
            <NotificationSettings />
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-7">
            <NotificationDisplay />
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="concept-card mt-4">
        <h4>📚 Dependency Injection & Config Concepts</h4>
        <hr class="my-2" style="border-color: var(--border-color);" />
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Singleton Configuration:</strong> <code>NotificationConfig</code> is registered as a singleton, maintaining state. Both the Settings and Display components share this instance.</li>
            <li><strong>Service Injection (DI):</strong> <code>NotificationService</code> is registered as scoped. The <code>NotificationConfig</code> is constructor-injected into the service, setting the default number of items.</li>
            <li><strong>Dynamic Presentation Toggle:</strong> The <code>NotificationDisplay</code> component reads the style parameter ("Compact" or "Detailed") and dynamically switches the HTML markup to adjust between a compact dots list and rich details cards.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>
